.TH ANDARU\-OUTBOUND 8 "" "Andaru" "Andaru Manual"
.nh
.ad l
.SH NAME
andaru\-outbound \- the service that talks to the outside world for Andaru
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
andaru outbound [\-\-bus\-socket PATH] [\-\-cache\-dir PATH]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run andaru\-outbound, the unprivileged service that talks to the outside world for the engine: it reads delivery jobs from the event bus and sends them, and fetches the lists of the address aliases fed from a URL or from host names. Its systemd unit runs it as the andaru\-outbound user.
.SH OPTIONS
.nf
  \-\-bus\-socket PATH  the bus socket for Andaru's services
                     (default /run/andaru\-services/bus.sock)
  \-\-cache\-dir PATH   where sent job IDs and jobs waiting for a retry are kept
                     (default $CACHE_DIRECTORY, else /var/cache/andaru\-outbound)
.fi
